#. narration
#: 00_archive.story:7
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|228673cda9ec2534"
msgid "October, 1903. The Archive of the House, two floors below the street."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 00_archive.story:8
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|0edbd1c7e6ec40f6"
msgid "The lamps are never put out down here. Paper is cheaper than daylight."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 00_archive.story:10
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|8b225b229a290804"
msgid "You're the new one. Sit."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 00_archive.story:11
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|4da46a236ae3d1f7"
msgid "I don't keep names I haven't needed yet. Write yours in the ledger."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 00_archive.story:13
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|d83b9e227b0230cd"
msgid "{player_name}. Good. Now forget it. Nobody down here will use it."
msgstr ""

#. {player_name} (dialogue)
#: 00_archive.story:14
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|1b1c0e027367bf02"
msgid "What am I to work on, Registrar?"
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 00_archive.story:15
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|c0dbc2ee8a9877ca"
msgid "Two things that were never meant to be read together."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 00_archive.story:17
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|6501cb6e2cc0853c"
msgid "Box fourteen. What was recovered from the Von Lucis residence. Never catalogued."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 00_archive.story:19
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|25a3731395b2a9db"
msgid "And nineteen reports from our field post at Santa Ilde. Numbers two hundred and three to two hundred and twenty-one."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 00_archive.story:21
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|9e89869e85896fce"
msgid "Report two hundred and twenty-one ends in the middle of a word."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 00_archive.story:22
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|6f15cab930bb18cb"
msgid "The man who wrote it has not come back. I want to know what he nearly wrote."
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 00_archive.story:24
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|5e1e1116d3474051"
msgid "Ask to be sent to Santa Ilde"
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 00_archive.story:24
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|0d73c75a51092567"
msgid "Read everything first"
msgstr ""

#. {player_name} (dialogue)
#: 00_archive.story:27
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|3d2d2cbc4f07887b"
msgid "I'll read the box first. All of it."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 00_archive.story:28
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|44c93a62b0f8ed75"
msgid "Slow. Good. Slow people last longer here."
msgstr ""

#. {player_name} (dialogue)
#: 00_archive.story:32
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|8a3a7a33ce0b59d2"
msgid "Why not send me to Santa Ilde and ask them?"
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 00_archive.story:33
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|797fd40bfb4ac96a"
msgid "Because the last three we sent forgot why they went."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 00_archive.story:34
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|1c64a434fe0ecaf4"
msgid "Read first. Then we'll see how eager you are."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 00_archive.story:36
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|00279a2bf8b0720e"
msgid "One more thing. What you read down here stays down here."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 00_archive.story:37
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|c1551fd91024cfa4"
msgid "And if a page ever feels like it is \"reading you back\", close the box and come and find me."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 00_archive.story:40
msgctxt "story|00_archive.story|e7770f7862dac88d"
msgid "The box smells of smoke and lavender. The first item is a notebook, in a young woman's hand."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:7
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|f7dbb59fad6e68f2"
msgid "Item 1. From the notebook of Mary Von Lucis. November, 1893."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:8
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|45fed32a2e5744e7"
msgid "Before the notebook there are the photographs: the study, as the House found it."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:10
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|15c678bf9b4b7538"
msgid "The letters from the Verlaine House come in pale envelopes that smell of perfume."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:11
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|3f52fff8fa6f2c93"
msgid "Father burns them in the study fireplace. I have counted three."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:13
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|6d6e6ec5dd2c320b"
msgid "The first one he laughed at. The second one he read twice."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:14
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|9d4584ff9455d587"
msgid "The third one he left open on the desk while he went to fetch his coat."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:15
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|153a24afd2908022"
msgid "I did not read it. His hands told me everything at supper."
msgstr ""

#. hugo (dialogue)
#: 01_box_14.story:18
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|cfb87a34aa8b46ee"
msgid "Mary. You should be in bed."
msgstr ""

#. mary (dialogue)
#: 01_box_14.story:19
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|91b46c56d79b60c6"
msgid "So should you, Father."
msgstr ""

#. hugo (dialogue)
#: 01_box_14.story:20
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|ab7e427def0b3bbc"
msgid "Go up. Lock your door tonight."
msgstr ""

#. mary (dialogue)
#: 01_box_14.story:21
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|348a151646df872f"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr ""

#. hugo (dialogue)
#: 01_box_14.story:22
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|36e7516f94faca27"
msgid "Because I asked."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:29
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|7434ce3e6d051733"
msgid "The Archive. Under the notebook there is an envelope, pale, sealed again with somebody else's wax."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:30
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|254f4f1e029b2adf"
msgid "Whoever put it in the box wanted it kept, and did not want it read."
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 01_box_14.story:32
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|1cdf61c5696ac425"
msgid "Break the seal"
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 01_box_14.story:32
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|e9b81912b188cc58"
msgid "Leave it sealed"
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:37
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|8d7abb161a1cdbea"
msgid "One word, and a signature. \"Von Lucis. Three days.\""
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:38
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|9441cb4eb06d21bc"
msgid "No \"Sir\". No \"Mister\". Only the name, as if it were a debt of its own."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:39
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|44180d9bdf1d7aab"
msgid "You check the house register in the box. Three days after that letter, a Von Lucis debt is marked paid."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:42
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|81551e8cdadbc8af"
msgid "You put it back where it was. She never read it either."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:49
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|e99a39b1fcf38a69"
msgid "Item 3. Mary's notebook again. The fourteenth of November, 1893."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:50
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|ee1b78339cc831d3"
msgid "I wake up and the candle has gone out on its own."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:51
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|b8c9b975774a4169"
msgid "I go to the window first. I always look at the windows first."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:52
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|3b4c93bfde0a1f2e"
msgid "Outside it is not night. Outside it is not anything."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:53
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|8488ec8a1192950f"
msgid "There is a voice downstairs. Father's voice, talking and talking, filling a silence."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:54
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|0fa29d962ae7621d"
msgid "He talks about the bloodline. He talks about having no heir."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:55
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|10cdd3a623293d8f"
msgid "Then he says my name."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:56
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|8d106624a8c2455f"
msgid "Nobody answers him. Nobody needs to."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:57
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|9cfba9a3f1090503"
msgid "I lie down again. I tell myself it was a dream, and for nine months it is."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:62
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|6f77d879b04b7231"
msgid "Item 4. Testimony of Adelaide Roque, lady's maid. Taken in August, 1894."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:63
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|6b9d115fc8bb4a19"
msgid "July 31st. The wind begins at night. It is not a rain wind. It comes from inside the house."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:64
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|97875e1b4180531b"
msgid "August 1st. I go in before the six o'clock bell, as I have every day for nine years."
msgstr ""

#. adelaide (dialogue)
#: 01_box_14.story:67
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|111752b63553ff1b"
msgid "Your hot water, miss. Miss? Are you unwell?"
msgstr ""

#. mary (dialogue)
#: 01_box_14.story:68
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|a04ef43947b4efbf"
msgid "Adelaide. Did I sleep last night?"
msgstr ""

#. adelaide (dialogue)
#: 01_box_14.story:69
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|56125f2dc52d0a07"
msgid "You did, miss. I put you to bed myself."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:70
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|c7d7f4b88c2d7be9"
msgid "She pulls back the blanket."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:73
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|58d6cd4e24732e75"
msgid "Yesterday there was nothing. Today it is nine months."
msgstr ""

#. mary (dialogue)
#: 01_box_14.story:74
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|52277b18e3bb9ae8"
msgid "Please. Don't tell anyone. Not yet."
msgstr ""

#. adelaide (dialogue)
#: 01_box_14.story:75
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|e07712c2487b53af"
msgid "Yes, miss."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:77
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|b0adab658001fde9"
msgid "I told. I went straight to her father. May God forgive me. May God forgive all of us."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:83
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|d3d8ef1762bb65bb"
msgid "Item 5. Mary's notebook. The last pages."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:84
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|6633ae23f3c4222d"
msgid "By the second day the whole house has chosen its word. Half say miracle. Half say sin."
msgstr ""

#. mary (dialogue)
#: 01_box_14.story:87
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|01acbe0b9c9a6dd0"
msgid "Father."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:88
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|f5a08eb91acad808"
msgid "He looks at the floor, at the window, at the door. Anywhere but my face."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:89
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|69d9219fd810573f"
msgid "And that is when I understand. I am not being punished for something I did."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:90
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|0dd8536c4c84e5fb"
msgid "I am being punished for something he did."
msgstr ""

#. hugo (dialogue)
#: 01_box_14.story:91
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|b806db4aa6bebaf4"
msgid "Go to your room, Mary."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:94
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|ed069a12ad0d6e35"
msgid "On the sixth of August the house scribe strikes my name from the register."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:95
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|326ddff892217b4b"
msgid "That night I take the servants' door, and one thing that is not mine."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:102
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|00175b60bb23c663"
msgid "The Archive. The Von Lucis register is in the box, and it has a column you have not seen in a register before."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:103
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|beeda94cdb250f6b"
msgid "Cause of the birth. For the eighth of August, 1894, it is empty."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:104
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|530ae6457768df66"
msgid "The House expects the archivist who opens a box to complete it. In ink."
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 01_box_14.story:106
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|02c0bfefbcdccb4f"
msgid "Write \"a miracle\""
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 01_box_14.story:106
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|6e82eb15cee4ea9c"
msgid "Write \"a sin\""
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 01_box_14.story:106
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|15fa6fcddcfab50e"
msgid "Write nothing, and initial the blank"
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:109
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|ec297fa93dffa15d"
msgid "You write it. The pen scratches louder than it should."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:112
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|63b55904b821816f"
msgid "You write it. It is what her father's house decided. Now it is what the House decided."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:116
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|f17f905dcf8c3dd9"
msgid "You initial the empty column. Somebody upstairs will ask why."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:123
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|5227f48dd5de7af2"
msgid "Item 6. A note left at the Santa Ilde orphanage, folded four times. Copied by the House in 1894."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:124
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|fc4d335ad7551d7b"
msgid "His name is Gabriel. I swear on my soul, which is not worth much anymore, I never knew the father."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:125
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|972c909bc3755400"
msgid "An object goes with this note. It is not a keepsake and not an inheritance. It is proof."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:126
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|e877ccafe75fa54d"
msgid "One day he will ask where he came from. Give him this."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:131
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|4030146f68f41260"
msgid "Item 7. A report from the men her father sent. August 8th, 1894."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:132
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|c4f364c0d3f574e1"
msgid "She was found on the old road by the river. She did not run."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:133
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|6588dfce8cb9f21d"
msgid "She turned around and looked at us, as if she wanted to remember our faces."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:134
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|66b8830332558559"
msgid "She was searched, and the bank and the road as far as the bridge. What we were sent for was not found."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:140
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|51a885c785f9ee6e"
msgid "Item 8. A loose sheet, in the hand of whoever compiled the box."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:141
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|2a02fc276745f92d"
msgid "The debt was paid on the fifteenth of November. The child was born on the eighth of August."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:142
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|65931b06059c03ab"
msgid "Two hundred and sixty-six days. A whole pregnancy. An exact one."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:143
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|00c2b26d3e5cdbfc"
msgid "Everyone repeats it with the word miracle, or with the word sin."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:144
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|86bd8ac891932124"
msgid "Nobody asks the only question that matters. Where was he for those nine months?"
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:146
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|6c40d1fe90ff4317"
msgid "You look at the word you wrote in the register, and it answers nothing."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 01_box_14.story:148
msgctxt "story|01_box_14.story|21f3384f90efce0d"
msgid "You look at the blank you initialled. At least it isn't lying."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:7
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|45fa0fc90e27ba2c"
msgid "Report two hundred and fourteen has an annex: a copy of the administrator's notebook, made by our man Francis in one night."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:11
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|22ea41171dec3a53"
msgid "July 12th, 1894. Santa Ilde. Lately I have begun to forget things."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:12
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|c3dad1e80c58db77"
msgid "It's all been signed since May. I leave Santa Ilde on my birthday and go to live with my sister."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:13
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|4529d8737d75db24"
msgid "So I am keeping a diary. I know that, eventually, I will forget to keep it too."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:14
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|443b9aa08b21714b"
msgid "The children have behaved better than usual, ever since the arrival of the"
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:16
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|38c222b7e7dba05b"
msgid "Ever since the guest arrived."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:20
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|08e2eb147a94ce3d"
msgid "July 14th. I am writing down what the guest looks like, because tomorrow I may not."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:22
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|658f09b55b60c2d7"
msgid "He is a tall man in a dark frock coat, thin enough to pity. He speaks little. He eats less."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:24
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|1cb62cfa4cc7a61e"
msgid "I read that back and it isn't right. He is broad in the shoulders. The coat is grey."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:25
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|43dc6e953c9c7fd7"
msgid "He eats normally, at the sisters' table."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:27
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|f5f0c3b53ce0a90d"
msgid "July 23rd. The guest left two days ago. Nobody can tell me how long he stayed."
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 02_notebook.story:30
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|9397511731d9ad70"
msgid "Sister Clara, the guest. How long was he with us?"
msgstr ""

#. clara (dialogue)
#: 02_notebook.story:31
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|9ede5f64f21c00ea"
msgid "What guest, Mr. Moriarty?"
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 02_notebook.story:32
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|da5dfdb5ded49931"
msgid "The man in the coat. At your table."
msgstr ""

#. clara (dialogue)
#: 02_notebook.story:33
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|0c72827366cc5443"
msgid "No guest stayed here this year."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:35
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|fe94d40d5723b606"
msgid "Sister Clara served him dinner every night."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:41
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|714ec5037a967756"
msgid "August 9th. A young woman came to the door after midnight, soaked through."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:44
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|8ce1108da19f656b"
msgid "She did not ask for discretion. She did not offer money. She did not cry."
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 02_notebook.story:45
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|07f826cb648e7d53"
msgid "What is his name?"
msgstr ""

#. mary (dialogue)
#: 02_notebook.story:46
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|bc4cb318bffeceeb"
msgid "Gabriel."
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 02_notebook.story:47
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|1059b0dc94bdb034"
msgid "And his family name?"
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:48
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|ac455e340c495b55"
msgid "She looked at the door."
msgstr ""

#. mary (dialogue)
#: 02_notebook.story:49
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|979db6c8748f574a"
msgid "Don't let anyone come looking for me."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:51
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|e57ce3275b5f4d37"
msgid "I decided to take him in."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:56
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|9d441c03d2fb1dd2"
msgid "August 11th. Men came this morning. Three of them, in black, polite in a way that makes you cold."
msgstr ""

#. man_in_black (dialogue)
#: 02_notebook.story:59
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|7fbf8dfcdaab40c1"
msgid "Good morning. Has a new child come in this week?"
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 02_notebook.story:60
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|6fd4667b6ba9b437"
msgid "No. No one new."
msgstr ""

#. man_in_black (dialogue)
#: 02_notebook.story:61
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|76775b0efddf0ec1"
msgid "Thank you for your time."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:63
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|cd35bff60ee335de"
msgid "I lied to an armed man before breakfast, and I do not recognise myself."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:64
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|dd3c18ff8af103ac"
msgid "Afterwards I unwrapped the boy's cloths to change him, and there was"
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:65
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|c78d793ee7d5d7d3"
msgid "..."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:66
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|e664abeed04e6ad6"
msgid "(The sentence ends mid-line. The next page has been torn out at the stitching.)"
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:72
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|e0c1256617d54d6c"
msgid "The Archive. Francis copied the notebook faithfully, down to the torn page. He copied the indentations too."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:73
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|67f774567579041c"
msgid "Whoever wrote on the missing page pressed hard enough to mark the next one."
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 02_notebook.story:75
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|3deb2c8ae38d7e54"
msgid "Hold the page to the lamp"
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 02_notebook.story:75
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|8a247bb88d0e8a0b"
msgid "Leave it"
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:78
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|7b7645b9db1e8f6e"
msgid "You tilt it against the lamp until the grooves catch the light."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:79
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|85521ea7f194b6de"
msgid "\"...a page from a register, folded small. Folio 41. His name is on it, and a price...\""
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:83
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|a424ddd02c3a48b9"
msgid "You turn the page. Some things are torn out for a reason."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:90
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|28872bb3d3938bc0"
msgid "Part II of the annex. A conversation in the administrator's office, 1901, written down by Francis."
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 02_notebook.story:93
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|26ee67f7d2352bdd"
msgid "Read it. Then you'll understand why I talk about that half-year the way I do."
msgstr ""

#. francis (dialogue)
#: 02_notebook.story:94
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|c631592d3d2c4bdf"
msgid "Then why did you stay? After everything in there?"
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 02_notebook.story:95
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|bab2eef3befd3729"
msgid "I grew attached. To my colleagues. To Gabriel."
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 02_notebook.story:96
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|9edba53497f4c3ec"
msgid "Look after a child for seven years and then tell me you can pack your bags."
msgstr ""

#. francis (dialogue)
#: 02_notebook.story:97
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|eab9971a5f1d465f"
msgid "The torn page. What was in the boy's cloths?"
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 02_notebook.story:98
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|063fad58a85e18eb"
msgid "Nothing. Cloths."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:99
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|f49cdf51ed0578ad"
msgid "The only quick answer of the night. It had been ready for years."
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 02_notebook.story:100
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|1a382669eaf5279a"
msgid "And Francis. Whoever it is you write to at night, tell them this."
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 02_notebook.story:101
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|4c504de84e2da8e1"
msgid "There's no family here. There's a boy."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:105
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|d5694d77260e2e8c"
msgid "In Francis's copy, somebody at the field post wrote in the margin: \"A diversion. Not to be treated as information.\""
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 02_notebook.story:107
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|208f606cd69609d1"
msgid "Let the margin note stand"
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 02_notebook.story:107
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|f1d671b97a2984e6"
msgid "Underline his last words"
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:110
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|6ac32938343c63fb"
msgid "You underline them twice, under the margin note, where the next reader will see both."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 02_notebook.story:112
msgctxt "story|02_notebook.story|6fb391b597528d40"
msgid "The field post knew the man. You didn't. You let it stand."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:7
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|db7d6e77836ba963"
msgid "Report No. 203. Santa Ilde has owed us servants since 1871. In 1898 the numbers fell by half. In 1899 they stopped."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:8
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|2eba7d7945d5c437"
msgid "A house that breaks with one House is in trouble. A house that breaks with four is being carried."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:9
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|25d179eb6f6bc0dd"
msgid "Report No. 206. A note from the House, for the younger men who still mix up the terms."
msgstr ""

#. house_envoy (dialogue)
#: 03_reports.story:11
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|213b06dc620a9a3a"
msgid "A signature is learned. A blessing is inherited."
msgstr ""

#. house_envoy (dialogue)
#: 03_reports.story:12
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|b8b3f902703a4f38"
msgid "If there is a hand at work in Santa Ilde, someone trained it. Find the master and you find the hand."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:14
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|242db7a1af71fee3"
msgid "We are looking for the master."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:18
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|6ad43322a23ebcff"
msgid "Report No. 217. The shadows arrived on the eleventh. There are three."
msgstr ""

#. shadow (dialogue)
#: 03_reports.story:20
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|6e78861b7ea6df42"
msgid "There is residue in Santa Ilde, and a great deal of it. In the young children's wing."
msgstr ""

#. shadow (dialogue)
#: 03_reports.story:21
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|f37830d2484e0ee7"
msgid "The residue has no master. It is as if someone were writing without ever having seen a letter."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:23
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|b97cc49ee7af3b2a"
msgid "The third shadow sweeps the old wing, closed since '94. He comes back in the morning and asks why we are in Santa Ilde."
msgstr ""

#. shadow_third (dialogue)
#: 03_reports.story:24
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|ff7c2f62cfe49a4d"
msgid "Why are we in Santa Ilde?"
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:25
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|a2a057cf14e21ef3"
msgid "Half an hour later. The same question."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:27
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|e9f99ff5dac92b88"
msgid "Neither of the other two remembers that there were three of them."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:33
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|9698d808d7c9f5b0"
msgid "Report No. 219. We went to the Von Lucis residence. We are late. Someone methodical was here before us."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:34
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|7599db15f1c066a9"
msgid "Folio 41 of the register has been torn out. The floorboard by the fireplace is loose, and the space beneath it is empty."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:36
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|b156a821567d1336"
msgid "You stop reading. Folio 41. You have seen that number before, pressed into a page from 1894."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:37
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|ce8d6ec16dbd7ce6"
msgid "Someone is putting together the same story we are, and is three steps ahead."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:43
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|5f247162ff2f97cd"
msgid "Report No. 220. There is no use of signatures in Santa Ilde. No master. No rival House."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:44
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|b9de2cb6ed2f664c"
msgid "Whoever does this has a blessing. A blessing is inherited, and inheritance has blood. The blood there is Von Lucis."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:45
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|14fc79d712c563cf"
msgid "And whoever does it has no idea what he is doing."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:46
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|b46f194658181dd2"
msgid "If the child does not know what he does, someone decided for him, and has been deciding since 1894."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:47
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|b6e68d63cc510292"
msgid "And that person knows exactly what they hold."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:51
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|c0e64cf995884afc"
msgid "Report No. 221."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:52
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|392c85079bfcc47b"
msgid "(Hurried handwriting. The ink is smeared across two lines.)"
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:54
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|ae96394a93cab95f"
msgid "One of the shadows claims to have discov"
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 03_reports.story:55
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|347e919c2a519ff2"
msgid "..."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 03_reports.story:59
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|da072fd3770b3d71"
msgid "Well?"
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 03_reports.story:61
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|ff8c3e0789c1ba97"
msgid "You wanted to go and ask them. Go and ask them."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 03_reports.story:63
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|42f49de6f5c86d8b"
msgid "You've read it all. Now go and look at it."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 03_reports.story:64
msgctxt "story|03_reports.story|96b655ec79ab5b56"
msgid "Santa Ilde. Ask for the administrator. Don't ask for the boy."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:7
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|cc2cb2305b6bd606"
msgid "November, 1903. Santa Ilde is smaller than the reports made it sound. Twenty-one windows. Somebody is singing."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:10
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|9aae8779120a96a2"
msgid "The administrator comes out to meet you before you knock. He has worn the same coat for nine years."
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:11
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|74bc015943f8cdc0"
msgid "You're not the bishopric. The bishopric sends letters."
msgstr ""

#. {player_name} (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:12
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|8b89b5f2f840ee16"
msgid "My name is {player_name}."
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:14
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|8a12650ebebd2a6b"
msgid "Say the House sent you"
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:14
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|8bb8dc54a26d8e44"
msgid "Say you're from the bishopric"
msgstr ""

#. {player_name} (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:17
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|dd024c24e361a827"
msgid "I'm from the House. The Archive."
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:18
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|a5deffd63685f330"
msgid "Honest. That's rarer than you'd think. Come in."
msgstr ""

#. {player_name} (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:21
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|67c93821f6b6f22d"
msgid "The bishopric sent me, after all."
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:22
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|96a7797c47ed4cb7"
msgid "The bishopric doesn't know how many children live here. Come in anyway."
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:29
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|360cea12221e0873"
msgid "Ask your questions. I'll tell you which ones I've forgotten the answers to."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:31
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|f455a84b09b9d344"
msgid "The folio number is on the tip of your tongue."
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:32
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|44b20d5d2d833b06"
msgid "Ask about folio 41"
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:32
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|457afafd063ec7e2"
msgid "Keep it to yourself"
msgstr ""

#. {player_name} (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:35
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|02e4a78d078e1d84"
msgid "What was in the boy's cloths, Mr. Moriarty? Folio 41?"
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:36
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|7194cd32a7fd9bb6"
msgid "Who else has read that page?"
msgstr ""

#. {player_name} (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:39
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|dfc37254234f720d"
msgid "Only me. And I underlined what you said to Francis."
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:40
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|b852662157413411"
msgid "Then you already know what I'd say. A boy. Not a family."
msgstr ""

#. {player_name} (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:43
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|ebfd1a28a0f363e5"
msgid "The field post."
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:44
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|78b998ffe35cfbcb"
msgid "Then you have your answer, and so do they."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:46
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|c9b0623407d25f67"
msgid "You keep the number to yourself. He watches you do it."
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:48
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|58c122f1b1523987"
msgid "No questions? The last ones had a list."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:54
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|92768a53f0ccd59b"
msgid "The nursery is empty except for one boy, nine years old, sitting on the floor by the window."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:55
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|ad5b2af65d3926cc"
msgid "Beside him there is a painted wooden horse. It was not there when you came in."
msgstr ""

#. gabriel (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:57
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|a371c06d60976872"
msgid "Are you going to forget me too? The last man forgot me."
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:59
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|4e6f4f073ff0c41a"
msgid "Ask him where the horse came from"
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:59
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|c87cb4fae9b91936"
msgid "Write it down"
msgstr ""

#. {player_name} (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:62
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|ff1f882acc7f21bb"
msgid "Where did the horse come from?"
msgstr ""

#. gabriel (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:63
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|1be5618133bca24d"
msgid "I wanted it."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:64
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|7b8c95e9945ba813"
msgid "He holds it out to you. Moriarty, in the doorway, lets out a breath."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:68
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|f49e8908663380ca"
msgid "You note the time, the toy, the window. The House will want to know. The boy watches the pencil."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:76
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|5167550849292bb5"
msgid "The sister who brings you tea keeps her eyes down. She has been at Santa Ilde longer than anyone but the administrator."
msgstr ""

#. clara (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:77
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|e50d16ce00125d71"
msgid "Your hot water, miss."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:79
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|c865224f8159b2fc"
msgid "Four words. You have read them before, in a testimony taken in August 1894."
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:80
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|a08c2c5c7a484fae"
msgid "Call her Adelaide"
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:80
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|628f5ac1ffa58542"
msgid "Thank her, and let it go"
msgstr ""

#. {player_name} (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:85
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|0cbf116745df171e"
msgid "Thank you, Adelaide."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:86
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|1fc48b59f9dad64e"
msgid "The cup does not shake. She has been waiting nine years for somebody to say it."
msgstr ""

#. clara (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:87
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|b851d403341262ff"
msgid "I told her father. I went straight to him, like a good servant."
msgstr ""

#. clara (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:88
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|25c751cadeb081c0"
msgid "I've spent every day since deciding things for her son instead."
msgstr ""

#. clara (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:89
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|ca448315d8f94c22"
msgid "The floorboard was mine, too. Your people were three steps behind. I made sure of it."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:91
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|6773751dbbc296c2"
msgid "You thank her. She leaves. Some names are safer where they are."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:93
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|6f4a09f0346c9ca8"
msgid "You thank her. She leaves without a sound."
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:102
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|bc9cb298188dcfe9"
msgid "You'll write something about us. Everyone who comes here does."
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:104
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|e968c34acad95b28"
msgid "Write it carefully. He's the only reason this house still has children in it."
msgstr ""

#. moriarty (dialogue)
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:106
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|1ef48b51cb054588"
msgid "Write what you like. We've been written about before."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 04_santa_ilde.story:108
msgctxt "story|04_santa_ilde.story|e3077d45061cb6e5"
msgid "You sign the visitors' book on your way out. Whatever you do next, you have been to Santa Ilde."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 05_report.story:7
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|48df88db2183dfda"
msgid "Before you answer there is the box, and the question of what goes in with the report."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 05_report.story:10
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|89707f71ce1f19c7"
msgid "Report two hundred and twenty-two. Yours. What is in Santa Ilde?"
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 05_report.story:15
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|5567640ec515b385"
msgid "You think of a wooden horse, a woman who waited nine years, and a man who kept a promise he couldn't remember making."
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 05_report.story:16
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|93acb24b572aeb7a"
msgid "\"Nothing.\" Then go back"
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 05_report.story:24
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|88890eab46c1f3aa"
msgid "\"A boy with a blessing. The Von Lucis blood.\""
msgstr ""

#. choice
#: 05_report.story:24
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|1190fdfd2df880de"
msgid "\"Nothing the House needs.\""
msgstr ""

#. {player_name} (dialogue)
#: 05_report.story:34
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|330b65e09b6d9a22"
msgid "A boy with a blessing. The blood is Von Lucis. He doesn't know what he does."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 05_report.story:35
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|7717ddc126942bf4"
msgid "Thank you, {player_name}. That is what an archive is for."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 05_report.story:38
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|99679ec02eb07808"
msgid "In December, three men in black knock at the door of Santa Ilde. Polite, in a way that makes you cold."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 05_report.story:39
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|86c2037d26810f7d"
msgid "The administrator tells them there is no one new. It is true. The boy has been there for nine years."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 05_report.story:41
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|9e1477230732aae0"
msgid "Report 222 is filed under Von Lucis. Nobody asks you where he was for those nine months."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 05_report.story:42
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|c7d77737cf34c1fc"
msgid "You never write another report that anyone reads twice."
msgstr ""

#. {player_name} (dialogue)
#: 05_report.story:48
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|f51d5cb0ac6b0412"
msgid "Nothing the House needs. An old man, twenty-one children and a very quiet wing."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 05_report.story:50
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|779899bb7f1ec078"
msgid "You initialled a blank in the Von Lucis register. You wanted to go there before you'd read a page."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 05_report.story:51
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|24ba5b6bebfd33bd"
msgid "Then we'll send someone who'll find something."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 05_report.story:53
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|7acaef10ddeadcc4"
msgid "Then Santa Ilde is closed. We have spent enough shadows on it."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 05_report.story:57
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|f4deaa5d3db71b2b"
msgid "Box fourteen goes back on its shelf. You put the reports in after it, in order, and you don't write the last word of 221."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 05_report.story:64
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|0847052410243b0e"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr ""

#. {player_name} (dialogue)
#: 05_report.story:65
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|a575a3a5efa45bd9"
msgid "An old man, twenty-one children and a very quiet wing. I'd like to be the one who keeps watching it."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 05_report.story:66
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|3b7abc9422df837f"
msgid "..."
msgstr ""

#. registrar (dialogue)
#: 05_report.story:67
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|1d5bf4052547abfa"
msgid "Report two hundred and twenty-two. Filed. Go."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 05_report.story:72
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|aa391ecb8cbcba0d"
msgid "In the spring you take a room in the town below Santa Ilde. Every week you write the House a report."
msgstr ""

#. narration
#: 05_report.story:73
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|007d4075f63b3997"
msgid "Every week it says the same thing, and every week it is true: there's no family here. There's a boy."
msgstr ""

#. gabriel (dialogue)
#: 05_report.story:74
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|ef56830041a8845b"
msgid "Are you going to forget me?"
msgstr ""

#. {player_name} (dialogue)
#: 05_report.story:75
msgctxt "story|05_report.story|9c3f3d31f202f495"
msgid "No. That's my whole job now."
msgstr ""

